      "scope_qualification": "此處管蔡、二叔指管叔鮮、蔡叔度；篇末管蔡世家是篇名。",
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "source_ranges": [
        {
          "work_id": "w-shiji",
          "book_id": "b-shiji-130",
          "chapter_id": "c-shiji-130-taishigong",
          "source_id": "s-shiji130-taishigong",
          "source_revision": 2609362,
          "source_permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷130&oldid=2609362",
          "paragraph_id": "c-shiji-130-taishigong:p046",
          "mention_id": "c-shiji-130-taishigong:m046-0017",
          "start": 17,
          "end": 19,
          "surface": "管蔡",
          "quote": "武王克紂，天下未協而崩。成王既幼，管蔡疑之，淮夷叛之，於是召公率德，安集王室，以寧東土。燕噲之禪，乃成禍亂。嘉甘棠之詩，作燕世家第四。",
          "paragraph_text_sha256": "f62767fdccb65b61133b65f48529417364f383ebd420656da54e08b542645e0b"
        },
        {
          "work_id": "w-shiji",
          "book_id": "b-shiji-130",
          "chapter_id": "c-shiji-130-taishigong",
          "source_id": "s-shiji130-taishigong",
          "source_revision": 2609362,
          "source_permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷130&oldid=2609362",
          "paragraph_id": "c-shiji-130-taishigong:p047",
          "mention_id": "c-shiji-130-taishigong:m047-0000",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2,
          "surface": "管蔡",
          "quote": "管蔡相武庚，將寧舊商；及旦攝政，二叔不饗；殺鮮放度，周公為盟；大任十子，周以宗彊。嘉仲悔過，作管蔡世家第五。",
          "paragraph_text_sha256": "1c5321f5a1008de14de53d0004b699d6ae88153e1bca9f918fc11e261082e53e"
        },
        {
